  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Translation services for Senior Officials Meeting (SOM) on the Sahel and Lake Chad regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The application for funding is specifically linked to translation services (from 1pm to 3.30pm) in relation to the hosting of the SOM in Dakar, where DK is a co-organiser together with DG ECHO. The SOM is to be held in Dakar, Senegal, on 6 October.</narrative>
